Value Filldown VRF ([^\"]+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value IP_ADDRESS (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL (up|down)
Value LINK_STATUS (up|down)
Value ADMIN_STATUS (up|down)

Start
  ^IP Interface Status for VRF "${VRF}"(?:\(\d+\))?\s*$$
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IP_ADDRESS}\s+protocol-${PROTOCOL}/link-${LINK_STATUS}/admin-${ADMIN_STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
